<title>THAILAND: Bank of Thailand bill auction results.</title>
<headline>Bank of Thailand bill auction results.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Thailand announced the following results for its bills issue on Friday:</p>
<p>    MATURITY  TENDER AMT  ALLOTED AMT  AVG YIELD   RANGE</p>
<p>		  (MLNS BAHT) (MLNS BAHT)</p>
<p>    27 days    4,930	 2,000	   9.21     9.04-9.38</p>
<p>    91 days    4,240	 1,000	   9.69     9.03-9.90</p>
<p>   188 days    3,225	 1,000	   9.86     9.49-10.18</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
